OL,3,GNEWSAU18s team making club history in
OL,4,AFA Youth Cup
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn under-18 football team say they do
OL,7,Fnot fear their opponents in the next
OL,8,Fround of the FA Youth Cup, despite
OL,9,Fbeing drawn against a professional
OL,10,Facademy team.
OL,12,FCobham Football Club U18s have been
OL,13,Fdrawn at home against Exeter City's
OL,14,Facademy team in the tournament's second
OL,15,Fround proper.
OL,17,FThe Surrey club says this is the
OL,18,Ffurthest it has ever gone in the youth
OL,19,Fcompetition. The team would face
OL,20,FWrexham's academy side should they come
OL,21,Fout on top in the match on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
