OL,3,GNEWSAU18s team making club history in
OL,4,AFA Youth Cup
OL,5,
OL,6,FCobham U18 captain Pawel said: "It's
OL,7,Fthe hardest game we've had but still I
OL,8,Fthink it's winnable with the bunch of
OL,9,Flads we have."
